export const heroLore = {
  1: { short: "Anti-Mage was raised by monks who trained him to loathe and hunt magic users. He wields twin blades and psychic energy rather than spells, letting him strike where casters feel safest. His Mana Break drains and punishes anyone foolish enough to rely on magic near him. Blink lets him vanish and reappear beside a target before they can react. Above all, Anti-Mage fights alone, trusting no army and no wizard, only his own speed and steel." },
  2: { short: "Axe is a brutal, laughing warlord who craves nothing more than a worthy fight. He goads enemies into striking him first with Counter Helix, punishing their aggression instantly. Berserker's Call forces foes to attack him whether they want to or not. He revels in chaos, believing the best battles are the ones where death is closest. To Axe, war is not a burden but the purest joy life offers." },
  3: { short: "Bane is a nightmare given form, feeding on the fears and dreams of those he touches. He slips into enemy minds with Nightmare, trapping them in paralyzing visions. Brain Sap lets him devour a foe's vitality to sustain his own strange existence. Fiend's Grip locks a target in psychic agony while he drains their will. Few remember what horrors Bane shows them, only that they woke changed." },
  4: { short: "Bloodseeker is drawn like a shark to the scent of spilled blood on the battlefield. Thirst reveals wounded enemies to him no matter where they hide. Rupture forces fleeing foes to tear themselves apart with every step they take. Bloodrage lets him fuel allies and himself with pain, sacrificing safety for power. He does not fight for glory or cause, only for the next kill." },
  5: { short: "Crystal Maiden was frozen for years within an ancient glacier before her magic finally broke free. Her ice spells, once sealed inside her, now radiate outward to slow and freeze her enemies. Frostbite locks a foe in place while frost gnaws at their skin. Despite the cold she commands, she remains gentle and devoted to her allies. She fights to ensure no one else is trapped as she once was." },
  6: { short: "Drow Ranger is a ranger of drow blood raised among humans after her kin were slain. She holds a quiet, simmering rage toward those who wronged her people. Frost Arrows chill anything her longbow strikes from a great distance. Marksmanship lets her precision shine when no enemy dares stand close. She trusts the shadows and her aim far more than she trusts words." },
  7: { short: "Earthshaker is an elemental force bound loosely into the shape of a warrior of stone. Fissure splits the earth itself to block or crush anything in its path. Enchant Totem turns his simple weapon into a devastating, world-shaking hammer. Echo Slam punishes clustered enemies with a shockwave that multiplies with every foe nearby. He does not walk so much as the world trembles wherever he goes." },
  8: { short: "Juggernaut is the last swordsman of a sacred sect devoted to honorable combat. Blade Fury spins him into a living cyclone that shreds anything too close. Blade Dance rewards his precision with devastating critical strikes. Omnislash lets him become a blur of steel, cutting down multiple foes in an instant. He fights not for kingdoms or gold, but to prove his order's ancient art still lives." },
  9: { short: "Mirana is a moon-blessed princess who abandoned her throne to hunt beneath the night sky. Sacred Arrow lets her stun a distant enemy with a single perfect shot. Leap carries her across the battlefield with feline grace. Moonlight Shadow calls down her patron's power to hide her allies in protective darkness. She serves the moon goddess Selemene, and her arrows never truly miss what matters." },
  10: { short: "Morphling is a being of living, sentient water with no fixed form of its own. Waveform lets it surge across the battlefield as a rushing torrent. Adaptive Strike shapes a jet of water into a piercing, damaging blow. Morph allows it to steal the very strength and agility of its foes. It has no true home, only an endless search to understand what it means to have a shape." },
  11: { short: "Shadow Fiend is a soul-collecting demon who harvests the essence of the fallen. Shadowraze scorches the ground with fire fueled by souls he has claimed. Necromastery grows his power with every soul he adds to his collection. Requiem of Souls unleashes his hoarded dead in a devastating wave of dark energy. The more souls he gathers, the more terrifying and powerful he becomes." },
  12: { short: "Phantom Lancer is an illusionist swordsman whose true form is nearly impossible to find. Spirit Lance skewers foes with a spectral spear that also spawns an illusion. Doppelganger lets him vanish entirely, leaving only copies of himself behind. Juxtapose fills the battlefield with duplicates every time he lands a hit. Facing him means fighting an army that may only be a single, elusive man." },
  13: { short: "Puck is a mischievous faerie dragon who treats war as an elaborate game. Illusory Orb sends a phantom sphere skimming across the battlefield ahead of its caster. Phase Shift lets Puck slip briefly out of reality to dodge any danger. Dream Coil traps enemies in a ring of dream-energy that punishes their escape attempts. To Puck, even the deadliest battle is just another delightful trick." },
  14: { short: "Pudge is a bloated, rotting butcher who once served as an executioner before becoming something far worse. Meat Hook drags distant victims toward him with a grotesque, barbed chain. Rot poisons the very air and ground around his festering body. Dismember lets him tear chunks from a captured foe while healing from their pain. He hungers endlessly, and no amount of flesh ever seems to satisfy him." },
  15: { short: "Razor is a lightning elemental barely contained within a suit of storm-forged armor. Static Link tethers him to an enemy, siphoning their strength into raw electrical power. Plasma Field expands outward in a ring of crackling, damaging energy. Unstable Current builds unbearable charge that eventually must be unleashed on anyone nearby. He is less a warrior than a controlled storm waiting to break loose." },
  16: { short: "Sand King is a monstrous wyrm-like creature that dwells beneath the desert wastes. Burrowstrike lets him tunnel beneath the earth and erupt violently beside his prey. Sand Storm chokes the battlefield in blinding, damaging dust. Epicenter shakes the ground itself in devastating pulses that grow stronger with time. He rises only to feed, and the desert remembers every place he has struck." },
  17: { short: "Storm Spirit is a being of pure lightning who broke free of his mortal shell long ago. Overload charges his next spell or attack with a burst of electric force. Electric Vortex drags an enemy inexorably toward him against their will. Ball Lightning lets him streak instantly across any distance the battlefield allows. He no longer remembers his old life, only the endless, electric hunger to move faster." },
  18: { short: "Sven is a paladin whose blade was severed from an ancient, corrupted god of war. Storm Hammer sends a crackling wave of force through his enemies. Great Cleave lets his massive strikes carve through entire lines of foes at once. God's Strength floods him with terrifying, unnatural power in the heat of battle. He fights to prove that a mortal hand can wield a god's fury with honor." },
  19: { short: "Tiny is an elemental giant formed from the mountain itself, growing larger with every battle he survives. Avalanche buries enemies beneath a crushing wave of stone. Toss lets him hurl anything, ally or enemy, across the battlefield like a pebble. Grow makes him larger and stronger the longer he stands his ground. He remembers little of what he once was, only the slow, patient strength of stone." },
  20: { short: "Vengeful Spirit is the ghost of a betrayed heroine sworn to punish those who wronged her family. Magic Missile stuns a distant enemy with concentrated spectral force. Vengeance Aura sharpens her allies' strikes wherever she stands beside them. Nether Swap lets her trade places with an ally or foe in an instant. She has died once already, and now nothing on the battlefield frightens her." },
  21: { short: "Windranger is a sharp-tongued archer whose command of wind rivals her skill with a bow. Shackleshot binds two enemies together if she can line up the perfect shot. Windrun makes her nearly untouchable as she dashes through danger unharmed. Focus Fire lets her unleash a relentless barrage against a single, chosen target. She trusts her instincts and her aim over any grand strategy." },
  22: { short: "Zeus is the exiled king of the heavens, still wielding lightning despite his fall from grace. Arc Lightning chains bolts of electricity between every enemy nearby. Lightning Bolt calls down a devastating strike from the storm clouds above. Thundergod's Wrath lets him strike every visible enemy across the map at once. Though banished, he has never once forgotten how to command the sky." },
  23: { short: "Kunkka is a legendary admiral whose ship was destroyed by a betrayal only he remembers clearly. Tidebringer lets his cursed cutlass carve through lines of enemies in a single swing. Torrent erupts from beneath the earth, mimicking the sea he lost long ago. Ghostship summons the spectral wreck of his old vessel to crash upon his foes. He drinks, laughs, and fights, but never truly forgets what the ocean took from him." },
  25: { short: "Lina is a fiery sorceress whose temper burns as hot as the spells she commands. Dragon Slave sends a wave of flame sweeping across the battlefield. Light Strike Array stuns and burns any enemy caught within its blast. Laguna Blade unleashes a devastating bolt of pure fire at a single target. She fights with impatience and pride, certain that no one can match her flame." },
  26: { short: "Lion is a dark sorcerer who traffics in curses, hexes, and the flesh of demons. Earth Spike bursts stone from the ground to stun a line of foes. Hex transforms an enemy into a harmless, helpless creature. Finger of Death channels raw death magic into a single devastating strike. He has traded much of his humanity for power, and he shows little regret for the bargain." },
  27: { short: "Shadow Shaman is a jungle witch doctor who commands loyal, venomous spirits to do his bidding. Ether Shock chains damaging magic between clustered enemies. Voodoo lets him shrink a foe into a harmless, tiny creature. Mass Serpent Ward summons a horde of serpents to swarm and destroy his enemies. He prefers to let his conjured servants do the fighting while he watches from safety." },
  28: { short: "Slardar is a deep-sea marauder who leads raids from the ocean's darkest trenches. Guardian Sprint lets him surge forward with terrifying, relentless speed. Sprint enables him to overtake fleeing prey before they can escape. Corrosive Haze strips away an enemy's armor, leaving them exposed to his crew's assault. He surfaces only to plunder, then vanishes back into the deep with his spoils." },
  29: { short: "Tidehunter is a titanic kraken who claims the seas and everything that dares sail them. Gush slams enemies with a crushing wave that slows their every move. Kraken Shell lets him shrug off damage that would fell lesser creatures. Ravage erupts around him in a devastating ring of tentacles and stone. No ship or army has ever truly conquered the waters he calls home." },
  30: { short: "Witch Doctor is a jungle shaman whose rituals blend healing magic with gruesome curses. Paralyzing Cask bounces a stunning hex between multiple unlucky enemies. Voodoo Restoration mends his allies' wounds even as he stands amid chaos. Death Ward summons a spectral totem that rains relentless damage on his foes. He serves his tribe's old ways faithfully, no matter how strange they may seem to outsiders." },
  31: { short: "Lich is the frozen remnant of a king who once ruled a kingdom long since fallen to ice. Frost Blast detonates freezing energy that slows everything it touches. Frost Nova bursts outward from him, damaging anyone who strays too close. Chain Frost bounces a relentless blast of cold between enemy after enemy. He rules nothing now but the cold, and he shares it freely with his foes." },
  32: { short: "Riki is a master thief who has perfected the art of never being seen at all. Blink Strike lets him close the distance on a target in the blink of an eye. Smoke Screen blinds and silences enemies caught within its choking haze. Tricks of the Trade allows him to strike multiple foes before they even notice he arrived. He measures his skill not by strength, but by how completely his victims never saw him coming." },
  33: { short: "Enigma is an ancient, cosmic being formed from the void between the stars. Malefice binds an enemy in painful, repeating psychic torment. Black Hole rips a section of the battlefield into a crushing, inescapable void. Midnight Pulse corrupts the very ground beneath his enemies' feet. Enigma does not see mortals as people, merely fascinating specks caught within its endless, patient hunger." },
  34: { short: "Tinker is a brilliant, reckless gnomish inventor who prefers gadgets to swords. Laser fires a focused beam of pure technological energy at a chosen enemy. March of the Machines unleashes a swarm of tiny robots to overwhelm the battlefield. Rearm resets his devices instantly, letting him repeat his tricks again and again. He treats every battle as an experiment, and he rarely minds the collateral damage." },
  35: { short: "Sniper is a sharp-eyed marksman who prefers to end fights long before anyone gets close. Shrapnel rains a hail of tiny explosives across a distant area. Headshot lets his shots stagger and slow anything they strike. Assassinate delivers a devastating, precise bullet from an almost impossible distance. He values distance and patience above all else, knowing that closeness only invites danger." },
  36: { short: "Necrophos is a plague doctor whose very presence spreads sickness and decay. Death Pulse damages nearby enemies while restoring life to his allies. Heartstopper Aura slowly drains the health of every foe near him. Reaper's Scythe finishes weakened enemies with a single, merciless strike of death magic. He does not fear disease, for death itself has long been his closest companion." },
  37: { short: "Warlock is a demon-summoning sorcerer who bends infernal creatures to his command. Fatal Bonds links enemies together so that damage to one echoes through them all. Upheaval tears the ground apart in a slow, spreading wave of chaos. Chaotic Offering summons a golem of pure infernal fury to smash his enemies. He treats even the most dangerous demons as simple tools for his ambitions." },
  38: { short: "Beastmaster commands a menagerie of loyal creatures across every corner of the wild. Wild Axes cut a spinning path of damage through anything they cross. Call of the Wild summons a hawk and boar to scout and fight at his side. Primal Roar stuns and displaces even the largest, most stubborn enemies. No forest, jungle, or plain feels foreign to a man the beasts themselves obey." },
  39: { short: "Queen of Pain is a succubus who feeds on suffering and revels in inflicting it upon others. Shadow Strike drives a blade of pain deep into a distant enemy. Blink lets her vanish and reappear wherever chaos calls her next. Sonic Wave sends a devastating pulse of pure agony across the battlefield. She fights for the simple, cruel joy of watching others break." },
  40: { short: "Venomancer is a plague-bringer whose body drips with lethal, ever-spreading poison. Poison Sting coats every attack with a lingering, damaging toxin. Plague Wards summon venomous creatures to guard territory and harass intruders. Poison Nova unleashes a devastating cloud of venom across the battlefield. He does not need to strike hard when his poison will do the work for him." },
  41: { short: "Faceless Void is an enigmatic being who can bend time itself to his will. Time Walk lets him rewind his own position, undoing any danger he just faced. Time Dilation locks nearby enemies into a slowed, sluggish version of time. Chronosphere freezes an entire area, allowing him and his allies to strike unopposed. No one has ever truly seen his face, only the moments he has stolen from them." },
  42: { short: "Wraith King is a fallen emperor cursed to rise again and again after every death. Wraithfire Blast stuns enemies with a burst of unholy, spectral flame. Vampiric Spirit drains life from his foes with every blow he lands. Reincarnation lets him return from death itself, refusing to stay buried. No army has ever managed to keep this king from reclaiming the battlefield." },
  43: { short: "Death Prophet is a seer whose visions of doom come wrapped in swarms of vengeful spirits. Carrion Swarm sends a flock of spectral crows tearing through enemy lines. Silence robs nearby foes of their ability to cast a single spell. Exorcism summons her spirits to relentlessly harass and damage her enemies. She has seen countless futures, and in most of them, she is the one who survives." },
  44: { short: "Phantom Assassin is a masked killer whose blades never seem to miss when it truly matters. Stifling Dagger throws a poisoned blade that slows any fleeing target. Blur makes her nearly invisible in the chaos of open battle. Coup de Grace lets her land devastating, fatal critical strikes at random. No one knows her true face, only the silence that follows wherever she strikes." },
  45: { short: "Pugna is a necromancer who wields decay itself as both weapon and shield. Nether Blast detonates a delayed burst of decaying magical energy. Decrepify slows and weakens a target while shielding them from further harm, at his choosing. Life Drain siphons health directly from an enemy into his own withering body. He treats life and death as simple currencies to be spent as he pleases." },
  46: { short: "Templar Assassin is a warrior of Skywrath trained to strike from angles no enemy expects. Refraction shields her from harm while amplifying her devastating attacks. Psi Blades let her strike multiple enemies in a single perfect line. Meld lets her vanish entirely before unleashing a critical, unavoidable blow. Her enemies rarely see her coming, and by then, it is already far too late." },
  47: { short: "Viper is a venomous predator who strikes from ambush and never lets prey escape alive. Poison Attack coats every hit with a corrosive, lingering toxin. Nethertoxin weakens and damages enemies who dare stand and fight him. Viper Strike immobilizes a distant target with a devastating burst of poison. He hunts with patience, certain that his venom will finish what his fangs begin." },
  48: { short: "Luna is a lunar knight blessed by the moon goddess she serves without question. Lucent Beam calls down a beam of pure moonlight to strike her enemies. Moon Glaive lets her attacks bounce between multiple foes at once. Eclipse rains beams of celestial light across the entire battlefield. She fights fiercely under the night sky, drawing strength from every phase of the moon." },
  49: { short: "Dragon Knight is a noble warrior who was granted the power to become a true dragon. Breathe Fire scorches enemies in a line with searing draconic flame. Elder Dragon Form transforms him entirely into a massive, armored dragon. Dragon Tail lets his tail sweep stun anyone unlucky enough to stand nearby. He has spent a lifetime proving that honor and monstrous power can coexist." },
  50: { short: "Dazzle is a shadow priest who wields death magic in service of healing and protection. Poison Touch slows and damages an enemy with a curse of decay. Shallow Grave shields a dying ally from death itself, if only for a moment. Bad Juju curses nearby enemies while lowering the cost of his own spells. He walks a strange line between necromancy and mercy, using one to fuel the other." },
  51: { short: "Clockwerk is a mechanical marvel built entirely from gears, steam, and battlefield ingenuity. Battery Assault unleashes a barrage of mechanical blows on nearby enemies. Power Cogs trap foes within a ring of spinning, inescapable gears. Hookshot lets him launch himself across the battlefield toward any target he chooses. He was built for war, and every joint and gear in him remembers that purpose." },
  52: { short: "Leshrac is a spirit of pure destructive magic, barely contained within a humanoid form. Split Earth cracks the ground open in a line of devastating force. Diabolic Edict curses an entire area with relentless, spreading damage. Pulse Nova radiates outward from him in continuous, punishing waves of energy. He does not seek conquest, only the simple, endless pleasure of watching things burn." },
  53: { short: "Nature's Prophet is a druidic wanderer who commands the forests themselves to fight his battles. Sprout traps enemies within a sudden ring of unyielding trees. Teleportation lets him summon himself instantly to any friendly location. Wrath of Nature sends a devastating chain of lightning sweeping across the map. He answers to no kingdom, only to the wild places he has sworn to protect." },
  54: { short: "Lifestealer is a ravenous creature who survives by tearing the very essence from his enemies. Rage lets him shrug off physical harm while charging fearlessly into battle. Feast drains a percentage of his target's health with every devastating bite. Open Wounds locks onto a fleeing enemy, draining them relentlessly as they run. He does not fear death, for he has learned to simply consume his way past it." },
  55: { short: "Dark Seer is a rogue mystic who bends space itself to protect and empower his allies. Vacuum pulls enemies violently together into a single, vulnerable point. Ion Shell surrounds an ally in a damaging field of crackling energy. Wall of Replica splits enemies with illusions that mimic their own power against them. He experiments freely with forces most mages consider far too dangerous to touch." },
  56: { short: "Clinkz is an undead archer bound to service by ancient, unbreakable oaths of loyalty. Searing Arrows coat his shots in burning, damaging fire. Wind Walk lets him fade into invisibility, striking before enemies even know he is near. Death Pact allows him to consume a fallen creature for temporary, monstrous power. His body may be bone and ash, but his aim remains as true as ever." },
  57: { short: "Omniknight is a devout paladin who channels divine power to shield and heal his allies. Purification burns a foe with holy fire while mending an ally's wounds. Repel wraps an ally in protective magic, immune to most physical harm. Guardian Angel grants his entire team a fleeting moment of true invincibility. He fights not for glory, but out of unwavering, sacred duty to protect the innocent." },
  58: { short: "Enchantress is a gentle forest spirit who has tamed even the wildest creatures to her side. Enchant turns a wild jungle creature into a loyal, obedient companion. Nature's Attendants summon healing spirits to mend her allies' wounds. Impetus adds devastating extra force to every shot fired at a distant enemy. She would rather protect the forest than fight, but she never hesitates when it needs defending." },
  59: { short: "Huskar is a fire-worshipping warrior who grows stronger and more reckless as his own wounds mount. Berserker's Blood fuels his power with every point of health he loses. Inner Vitality causes a target's wounds to burn and fester over time. Life Break sacrifices a portion of his own health to deliver a devastating strike. He believes pain is not something to avoid, but something to be embraced." },
  60: { short: "Night Stalker is a winged terror who only reveals his true, monstrous power after sundown. Void slows and silences an enemy caught in his crushing grip. Hunter in the Night grants him terrifying speed and power once darkness falls. Darkness plunges the entire battlefield into an early, unnatural night. He waits patiently for the sun to set, for the night belongs entirely to him." },
  61: { short: "Broodmother is an ancient spider matriarch who lairs deep within cursed, web-choked forests. Spawn Spiderlings summon a swarm of loyal offspring to overwhelm her enemies. Insatiable Hunger heals her with every strike she lands upon a foe. Incapacitating Bite poisons and weakens any enemy caught in her jaws. She does not leave her web willingly, but nothing that enters it ever truly escapes." },
  62: { short: "Bounty Hunter is a shadowy mercenary who tracks marked targets across the entire battlefield. Shuriken Toss throws a razor-sharp blade that slows a distant enemy. Track marks a target, revealing their location while rewarding their eventual death. Jinada empowers his next strike while briefly slowing his prey. He takes no job personally, only professionally, and he always collects his bounty." },
  63: { short: "Weaver is a strange, insectile creature who slips between dimensions to escape any danger. Shukuchi lets him vanish briefly into another plane, evading harm entirely. The Swarm surrounds enemies with tiny, damaging beetles over time. Geminate Attack doubles the force of his next two strikes. He barely understands the world he moves through, only that it is safer than the one he left." },
  64: { short: "Jakiro is a twin-headed dragon whose two minds share one fire-and-ice-wracked body. Dual Breath scorches and freezes enemies caught in its icy flame. Liquid Fire scatters burning oil across the ground, damaging anyone who lingers. Macropyre engulfs a wide area in relentless, spreading flame. His two heads rarely agree, but they are devastatingly effective when they finally do." },
  65: { short: "Batrider is a reckless goblin pilot who has fused himself permanently with his own fire-breathing mount. Firefly leaves a trail of burning flame wherever he flies. Flamebreak scorches the ground in a line of searing fire. Flaming Lasso drags a single enemy along wherever his bat decides to go. He cares little for careful plans, preferring instead to simply set everything ablaze." },
  66: { short: "Chen is a devout priest who commands loyal creatures liberated from the wild's cruelty. Penitence marks an enemy, slowing them while amplifying damage against them. Holy Persuasion converts a wild creature into a devoted, fighting ally. Hand of God heals his entire team in a single, holy pulse. He believes even the fiercest beast can be redeemed with enough patience and faith." },
  67: { short: "Spectre is a haunting figure who exists partly in the realm of the dead. Spectral Dagger leaves a lingering trail that speeds her toward any target she marks. Dispersion reflects a portion of incoming damage back onto her attackers. Haunt lets her illusions strike every enemy across the map at once. She moves like a memory that refuses to be forgotten, or escaped." },
  68: { short: "Ancient Apparition is a primordial spirit of endless cold, older than most gods and kingdoms alike. Cold Feet slowly closes an icy trap around a chosen enemy's position. Chilling Touch punishes an enemy's every attack with additional freezing damage. Ice Blast prevents a foe's health from regenerating, freezing them near death itself. He has watched empires rise and fall, and none of them impressed him." },
  69: { short: "Doom is a demonic overlord who wields ultimate power over the fate of his enemies. Devour lets him consume creatures whole to gain their unique abilities. Scorched Earth burns the ground he walks, damaging enemies and healing himself. Doom curses a single target, silencing them and slowly burning away their life. Once he marks a foe for death, there is very little they can do to escape it." },
  70: { short: "Ursa is a fierce warrior blessed with the raw, primal strength of the bear spirit. Earthshock Stomp slams the ground, stunning and damaging every nearby enemy. Overpower empowers his next attacks with devastating, relentless force. Enrage grants him near invulnerability while his fury burns brightest. He fights with feral instinct, growing more dangerous with every wound he takes." },
  71: { short: "Spirit Breaker is a wandering bull-headed mercenary whose charges are nearly impossible to escape. Charge of Darkness lets him thunder across the map toward any distant enemy. Bulldoze grants him unstoppable speed as he tramples through anything in his path. Greater Bash stuns enemies with the sheer, brutal force of his attacks. He answers to whoever pays him, but his charge answers to no one at all." },
  72: { short: "Gyrocopter is a battle-hardened pilot who brings an entire arsenal into every single fight. Rocket Barrage unleashes a relentless volley of homing rockets. Homing Missile locks onto a fleeing target and follows it across the battlefield. Call Down rains devastating explosives from high above onto his enemies. He treats every skirmish like a one-man war, and he rarely runs short on firepower." },
  73: { short: "Alchemist is a reckless chemist obsessed with turning gold, greed, and chaos into raw power. Unstable Concoction brews a volatile mixture that explodes for massive damage. Acid Spray corrodes the armor of every enemy caught nearby. Chemical Rage floods him with unstable strength and reckless speed. He is less concerned with lasting wealth than with the thrill of the next explosive experiment." },
  74: { short: "Invoker is an aging, brilliant sorcerer who has mastered more spells than perhaps any mortal alive. Quas, Wex, and Exort let him blend elements into countless different invocations. Cold Snap, Ghost Walk, and Tornado are just a fraction of his vast, elemental arsenal. Sun Strike lets him call devastating solar fire down on any point of the map. He has spent centuries perfecting his craft, and he still believes he has more to learn." },
  75: { short: "Silencer is a quiet monk who has trained his voice into a weapon far deadlier than any blade. Curse of the Silent slowly weakens the intellect of every enemy he opposes. Global Silence robs every visible foe of their ability to cast a single spell. Last Word denies dying enemies the ability to unleash their spells as they fall. He speaks rarely, letting his silence do far more damage than words ever could." },
  76: { short: "Outworld Destroyer is an entity from beyond reality who feeds on raw arcane knowledge. Arcane Orb converts pure intelligence into devastating, unavoidable ranged damage. Astral Imprisonment banishes a foe from the battlefield entirely, for a time. Sanity's Eclipse drains the mana of every nearby enemy in a punishing wave. He does not belong to this world, only visits it, hungry for what it knows." },
  77: { short: "Lycan is a savage werewolf chieftain who leads a pack of loyal wolves into every battle. Shapeshift transforms him into a swift, monstrous wolf capable of devastating speed. Summon Wolves calls forth loyal companions to fight and scout at his side. Feral Impulse sharpens both his and his wolves' senses in the heat of combat. He does not fight for kingdoms, only for the simple, ancient thrill of the hunt." },
  78: { short: "Brewmaster is a legendary drunken master whose martial skill only grows more chaotic with every drink. Thunder Clap stuns enemies with a mighty, resounding blow. Drunken Brawler shifts unpredictably between offensive and defensive fighting stances. Primal Split divides him into three elemental spirits, each fighting independently. He treats every battle like a tavern brawl, unpredictable, chaotic, and impossible to fully prepare for." },
  79: { short: "Shadow Demon is a cunning fiend who delights in twisting perception and reality alike. Disruption briefly banishes an enemy, then returns them straight into danger. Soul Catcher marks a target, exploding with damage if they are not soon healed. Demonic Purge slows and weakens a foe by stripping away their buffs. He rarely fights honestly, preferring instead to let confusion do most of the work." },
  80: { short: "Lone Druid is an isolated shapeshifter who prefers the company of his spirit bear to any army. Spirit Bear fights alongside him as a loyal, nearly independent companion. True Form lets him transform fully into a savage, powerful bear himself. Savage Roar frightens enemies away from him and his loyal companion alike. He has lived apart from society for so long that he barely remembers why he left." },
  81: { short: "Chaos Knight is a being born from the raw chaos between worlds, riding a spectral steed. Chaos Bolt hurls unpredictable, stunning energy at a chosen enemy. Reality Rift tears space itself, pulling him closer to his prey. Phantasm splits him into powerful illusions that fight exactly as he does. He does not believe in fate, only in the endless, unpredictable churn of chaos itself." },
  82: { short: "Meepo is a curious, cowardly creature who compensates for his weakness by simply cloning himself. Poof lets each clone teleport instantly to any other clone's location. Ransack tears through enemy defenses, weakening their armor with every strike. Earthbind roots enemies in place, letting his many clones swarm them at once. Alone he is fragile, but in numbers, Meepo becomes a small, relentless army." },
  83: { short: "Treant Protector is an ancient guardian spirit bound eternally to the forest he defends. Leech Seed drains health from an enemy while restoring an ally's vitality. Living Armor shields allies with bark that regenerates and absorbs damage. Overgrowth roots every nearby enemy in place with sudden, unyielding vines. He has stood watch over his woods for centuries, and he will not abandon them now." },
  84: { short: "Ogre Magi is a two-headed brute whose magical talent is entirely, hilariously accidental. Fireblast scorches an enemy with a stunning, uncontrolled burst of flame. Ignite sets enemies ablaze with lingering, damaging fire. Multicast occasionally lets his clumsy magic repeat itself several times over, by pure chance. He barely understands his own power, but that has never once stopped him from using it." },
  85: { short: "Undying is a restless spirit who commands the dead to rise and fight in his place. Decay weakens an enemy while transferring their strength to himself instead. Soul Rip drains life from nearby summoned creatures to heal his allies. Tombstone raises zombies from the ground to overwhelm his enemies. He does not fear the grave, for he has already crossed it and returned." },
  86: { short: "Rubick is a cunning arcane thief who has made a career of stealing spells from his enemies. Fade Bolt weakens a target while briefly reducing their magic damage output. Telekinesis lifts an enemy helplessly into the air before slamming them down. Spell Steal lets him seize and use an enemy's own ultimate ability against them. He collects power the way others collect trophies, one stolen spell at a time." },
  87: { short: "Disruptor is a wandering storm spirit who bends lightning and space to protect the natural world. Thunder Strike marks an enemy, striking them repeatedly with delayed lightning. Glimpse forces a fleeing enemy backward to where they stood moments earlier. Static Storm silences every enemy caught within its crackling dome. He travels the wilds freely, striking swiftly against anything that threatens the balance of nature." },
  88: { short: "Nyx Assassin is a chitinous predator that lurks unseen, waiting patiently to ambush its prey. Impale erupts spikes from the ground, stunning every enemy in a line. Vendetta lets him vanish completely until the perfect moment to strike arrives. Mana Burn drains and damages spellcasters who rely too heavily on their magic. He does not rush his kills, preferring instead the patient certainty of the perfect ambush." },
  89: { short: "Naga Siren is an oceanic empress whose illusions and song can overwhelm entire armies. Mirror Image conjures illusions so convincing that enemies struggle to find the real her. Ensnare traps a fleeing target in unbreakable, watery binds. Song of the Siren lulls every nearby enemy into a helpless, temporary slumber. She rules her underwater domain absolutely, and she rarely tolerates surface-dwelling intruders." },
  90: { short: "Keeper of the Light is an ancient guardian who has watched over the world since its earliest days. Illuminate scorches a line of enemies with concentrated, radiant light. Chakra Magic instantly refills an ally's mana to fuel their next spell. Spirit Form lets him unleash devastating beams of light from an ethereal, floating state. He has guided countless heroes before, and he will guide many more after this battle ends." },
  91: { short: "Io is a curious, wisp-like entity native to a realm entirely separate from the material world. Tether links Io to an ally, sharing health and mana between them both. Overcharge amplifies a tethered ally's damage at the cost of Io's own speed. Relocate teleports Io and a bonded ally instantly across the battlefield. Io does not fully understand mortal conflict, but it enjoys helping its chosen companion regardless." },
  92: { short: "Visage is a stone gargoyle animated by grief and vengeance after the loss of his family. Grave Chill slows and weakens enemies who linger too close to him. Soul Assumption builds destructive power with every ally or enemy death nearby. Summon Familiars calls forth loyal gargoyles to swarm and harass his foes. He fights with the cold patience of stone, and the burning fury of a father who lost everything." },
  93: { short: "Slark is a fish-like predator who fled the deep sea prisons after a lifetime of captivity. Pounce lets him leap onto a fleeing target from a surprising distance. Dark Pact purges harmful effects while damaging enemies caught nearby. Shadow Dance renders him nearly invisible, restoring his strength as he stalks his prey. He was locked away once, and now nothing on the battlefield can hold him for long." },
  94: { short: "Medusa is a serpent-haired gorgon whose gaze alone can turn the boldest enemy to stone. Mystic Snake sends a serpent slithering between enemies, draining their mana. Split Shot lets her arrows strike multiple foes with every single release. Stone Gaze petrifies any enemy unlucky enough to look directly at her. Few dare meet her eyes twice, and fewer still survive the attempt." },
  95: { short: "Troll Warlord is a battle-scarred chieftain who leads his tribe through sheer, relentless ferocity. Berserker's Rage fuels his attacks with unstoppable, mounting fury. Fervor increases his attack speed with every consecutive strike he lands. Battle Trance grants his entire tribe a surge of unstoppable, temporary strength. He values only strength and victory, and he has little patience for those who value anything else." },
  96: { short: "Centaur Warrunner is a proud tribal champion who charges headfirst into danger without a moment's hesitation. Hoof Stomp stuns nearby enemies with the crushing force of his charge. Double Edge sacrifices his own health for a devastating burst of damage. Stampede lets his entire team surge forward with terrifying, unstoppable speed. He leads from the very front, certain that hesitation is the only true weakness." },
  97: { short: "Magnus is a titanic bull-headed general who commands the battlefield with raw magnetic force. Shockwave sends a devastating line of force tearing through enemy ranks. Empower amplifies an ally's attacks with crackling, magnetic energy. Reverse Polarity yanks every nearby enemy violently toward him at once. He does not simply fight battles, he reshapes them entirely around his own overwhelming presence." },
  98: { short: "Timbersaw is a reckless engineer who fused himself with a massive, whirring chainsaw. Whirling Death spins his blades in a devastating circle around him. Timber Chain launches him toward the nearest tree, dragging enemies along with him. Chakram unleashes twin blades that carve a lasting, damaging path across the battlefield. He treats the forest as both his workshop and his weapon." },
  99: { short: "Bristleback is a thick-hided beast whose spines grow deadlier the more punishment he endures. Quill Spray launches a barrage of spikes at every nearby enemy. Bristleback thickens his own hide, reducing damage from attacks behind him. Viscous Nasal Goo slows and weakens enemies who dare strike him directly. He turns his back on danger deliberately, knowing his spines will do the real work." },
  100: { short: "Tusk is a jovial, brawling warrior who treats every battle like a hearty tavern contest. Snowball rolls him and an ally toward the enemy, growing larger with distance. Ice Shards erupt from the ground to trap a fleeing target in place. Walrus Punch occasionally lands with devastating, bone-crushing force. He fights with a laugh on his face, certain that any brawl can end in celebration." },
  101: { short: "Skywrath Mage is an arrogant, all-knowing spellcaster who considers himself the greatest wizard alive. Concussive Shot stuns and slows a fleeing enemy from a great distance. Ancient Seal silences a target, denying them access to their own spells. Mystic Flare unleashes a devastating storm of pure arcane fire. He rarely doubts himself, and so far, the battlefield has rarely proven him wrong." },
  102: { short: "Abaddon is a cursed knight bound to an undying mistress he serves without complaint. Mist Coil damages an enemy or heals an ally with equal, unsettling ease. Aphotic Shield protects an ally from harm, then explodes outward when broken. Borrowed Time triggers automatically to heal him at the very edge of death. He does not fear dying, for death has already proven unable to keep him down." },
  103: { short: "Elder Titan is a colossal being whose astral spirit can wander far from his massive, ancient body. Echo Stomp stuns and damages enemies near his sleeping, titanic form. Astral Spirit separates his consciousness to scout and empower his allies. Earth Splitter cracks the world itself along a devastating, lingering line. He has existed since the world's earliest ages, and little truly frightens him anymore." },
  104: { short: "Legion Commander is a disciplined general who honors only those who defeat her in single combat. Overwhelming Odds punishes clustered enemies with a devastating sweep of her blade. Moment of Courage grants her a chance to counterattack after taking damage. Duel challenges a single enemy to a fight neither can escape until one falls. She respects strength above all, and she never turns away a worthy challenge." },
  105: { short: "Techies are a pair of gleeful goblin engineers who have turned explosives into an art form. Land Mines litter the battlefield with hidden, devastating traps. Suicide Squad, Attack! lets them detonate themselves for a massive burst of damage. Remote Mines can be planted and triggered from a safe, patient distance. They rarely worry about the danger of their own creations, only the joy of watching them go off." },
  106: { short: "Ember Spirit is a fiery elemental born from an ancient conflict he barely survived. Sleight of Fist strikes multiple enemies in an instant before vanishing again. Flame Guard shields him from harm while burning enemies who dare strike back. Fire Remnant leaves duplicates of himself that can later explode with devastating fire. He moves like a flame catching wind, fast, unpredictable, and impossible to fully contain." },
  107: { short: "Earth Spirit is an elemental made of living stone who rolls across the battlefield with unstoppable momentum. Rolling Boulder lets him crash through enemies as an unstoppable sphere of rock. Boulder Smash launches a stone at an enemy, stunning and knocking them into obstacles. Magnetize binds enemies together, sharing damage between everyone caught inside. He moves at his own pace, patient as stone, until the moment he finally strikes." },
  108: { short: "Underlord is a demonic general who commands legions from the deepest, darkest reaches of hell. Firestorm rains persistent flame across a wide stretch of the battlefield. Pit of Malice traps enemies in a slowing, damaging field of infernal energy. Dark Rift lets his entire team teleport instantly to any point on the map. He does not fight alone, for he has never once needed to." },
  109: { short: "Terrorblade is a demon lord who stole his own monstrous form from a rival long ago. Reflection creates a duplicate that fights exactly as ferociously as he does. Metamorphosis transforms him into a hulking, melee demon of terrifying strength. Sunder lets him swap his own health directly with an enemy's, regardless of the cost. He took what he wanted once before, and he sees no reason to stop now." },
  110: { short: "Phoenix is a cosmic firebird whose very existence threatens to collapse into a supernova. Icarus Dive lets it soar across the battlefield, damaging anything below its path. Fire Spirits leave burning trails that slow and damage lingering enemies. Supernova collapses Phoenix into a star, then explodes with catastrophic force. It burns brightly and briefly, fully aware that its own fire might one day consume it." },
  111: { short: "Oracle is an enigmatic seer who claims to know the outcome of every battle before it begins. Fortune's End violently interrupts a target's buffs and healing effects. False Promise delays all damage a target would take, for better or worse. Fate's Edict forces an enemy into a state of vulnerable, magical purity. Few understand his cryptic warnings, but by the time the battle ends, they usually make sense." },
  112: { short: "Winter Wyvern is an ancient dragon who has embraced the cold rather than fear it. Arctic Burn coats her attacks with lingering, damaging frost. Splinter Blast fractures on impact, striking multiple nearby enemies at once. Winter's Curse locks nearby enemies together, forcing them to attack each other. She has outlived countless summers, and she trusts the cold far more than any fleeting warmth." },
  113: { short: "Arc Warden is a brilliant tinkerer who has learned to duplicate himself entirely on the battlefield. Flux weakens a target while slowly draining their strength over time. Spark Wraith plants a hidden, damaging trap that erupts when triggered. Tempest Double creates an exact, independent copy of himself to fight alongside him. He treats the battlefield as one more experiment, and doubling his efforts only sharpens the results." },
  114: { short: "Monkey King is a mischievous trickster armed with a magical staff and a knack for chaos. Boundless Strike extends his staff to strike a line of distant enemies. Tree Dance lets him leap between trees, striking foes as he passes overhead. Wukong's Command summons spectral soldiers to fight alongside him in battle. He answers to no throne but his own, and he enjoys every moment of the mischief he causes." },
  119: { short: "Dark Willow is a fey trickster whose beauty conceals a temper as sharp as any blade. Bramble Maze traps enemies within a thicket of thorny, damaging vines. Shadow Realm renders her briefly untargetable while she charges a devastating strike. Cursed Crown stuns and curses every enemy caught within its cruel radius. She plays at innocence, but few who cross her mistake it for real." },
  120: { short: "Pangolier is a wandering swordsman whose blade cuts through time as easily as flesh. Swashbuckle lets him dash forward, striking every enemy along his path. Rolling Thunder curls him into an unstoppable, damaging sphere of motion. Shield Crash reflects incoming damage while shattering nearby enemy shields. He travels alone by choice, but he never hesitates to leap into someone else's fight." },
  121: { short: "Grimstroke is an ink-formed sorcerer whose art can trap, bind, and unmake his enemies. Stroke of Fate lances a wave of ink through everything in its path. Spirit Walk lets him slip briefly beyond the reach of physical harm. Soul Chain binds two enemies together, sharing the damage between them. He paints his victories directly onto the battlefield, one devastating brushstroke at a time." },
  123: { short: "Hoodwink is a sharp-tongued forest scout who fights fiercely to protect her woodland home. Acorn Shot bounces damaging projectiles between multiple nearby enemies. Bushwhack traps a fleeing enemy within a snare of living vines. Sharpshooter channels a devastating, precise shot from a great distance away. She may be small, but her aim and her resolve are anything but." },
  126: { short: "Void Spirit is a wandering entity who slips between dimensions faster than most can track. Resonant Pulse fractures the space around him to damage nearby enemies. Aether Remnant creates a delayed echo that pulls foes toward its point of origin. Dissimilate lets him vanish into the void itself and reappear moments later. He does not belong fully to this reality, and he uses that fact to his full advantage." },
  128: { short: "Snapfire is a fierce, elderly grandmother who rides into battle atop an enormous, fire-breathing salamander. Scatterblast unleashes a spray of shrapnel at close range. Firesnap Cookie lobs an explosive treat that stuns anyone unlucky enough to eat it. Mortimer Kisses fires her loyal salamander at a distant, unsuspecting enemy. She fights with the fearless confidence of someone who has survived far worse than any battlefield." },
  129: { short: "Mars is a proud god of war who has descended to prove his strength still matters. Spear of Mars impales enemies, pinning them against any obstacle behind them. Bulwark shields him and his allies from ranged attacks with a mighty stance. Arena of Blood traps enemies within a divine arena, denying them any escape. He answers to no mortal command, only to the ancient thrill of righteous combat." },
  135: { short: "Dawnbreaker is a celestial blacksmith who forges hope out of even the darkest battles. Starbreaker strikes enemies twice with her radiant, molten hammer. Celestial Hammer flings her weapon across the battlefield before calling it swiftly back. Solar Guardian lets her descend from the heavens to aid any ally in danger. She believes every dawn deserves defending, no matter how dark the night before it." },
  136: { short: "Marci is a devoted protector who fights fiercely for the family she has chosen for herself. Rebound lets her leap toward an enemy or ally with surprising, sudden force. Guardian pushes an ally out of harm's way while she absorbs the danger instead. Unleash empowers her attacks with overwhelming, righteous force. She does not fight for glory, only for the people she has sworn to keep safe." },
  137: { short: "Primal Beast is a caged monstrosity finally freed to unleash generations of pent-up fury. Onslaught knocks enemies airborne with a devastating, primal charge. Trample lets him crush and injure everything caught beneath his charge. Pulverize traps a single enemy helplessly within his massive jaws. He has been contained for far too long, and now nothing holds him back." },
  138: { short: "Muerta is a spectral gunslinger who returned from the afterlife with a score still to settle. The Lost Art of Dying lets her fire spectral bullets that pass through enemies. Dead Shot channels a piercing, precise shot at a chosen target. Requiem of Slouls unleashes vengeful spirits to hound a chosen area. Death did not stop her once, and she has no intention of letting it stop her now." },
  145: { short: "Kez is a shapeshifting duelist whose blade and beastly form make him a nightmare to predict. Grasp of the Kez lashes out to punish enemies who dare stand their ground. Berserker's Mark exposes weaknesses in any foe unlucky enough to catch his eye. Emerald Slash carves through enemies with a sweeping, precise strike. He shifts between forms as easily as he shifts strategy, always one step ahead of his prey." },
};
 
export default heroLore;